# The application rule of the HM baseline (hindley_milner_unions), a module
# of its own so that a type check may type applications otherwise: an
# application of a function judged tf to an argument judged tx is judged by
# its type, type_of of the application, written as the choice of it and the
# unify node of tf and function_type tx (type_of of the application): both
# are top up to contextual equivalence, and the judgment is the application
# by absorption. hindley_milner_unions is hindley_milner_unions_judgments, this
# module and hindley_milner_unions_occurrences; wren_scott_elimination types
# applications by applied_type instead, with hindley_milner_unions_core.
